            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can an LG OLED be repaired by replacing LED strips?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "No. OLED pixels are self-lit, so there is no separate strip backlight. Power and board faults may still be repairable, while actual OLED panel damage requires a different cost assessment."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Should I repeatedly run LG pixel cleaning to remove a mark?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Follow the instructions for your exact LG model. Do not repeatedly force a maintenance cycle or assume every mark will clear. Photograph the symptom and seek model-specific advice if it persists."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Is an LG television collected automatically after booking in Noida?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "No. The inspection determines whether work can remain at home or needs workshop facilities. A collection plan, handling and any charge should be explained before the television is moved."
            }
          }
